WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.023
In one minute, you will find the neighborhood contests, and where to vote or enter.

00:00:05.023 --> 00:00:06.124
We start on the map.

00:00:07.027 --> 00:00:10.359
Open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:14.572
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:14.572 --> 00:00:17.062
A message asks to use your location.

00:00:17.062 --> 00:00:18.408
Tap Use my location.

00:00:20.154 --> 00:00:22.370
Your browser asks for permission.

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:23.022
Tap Allow.

00:00:26.543 --> 00:00:29.038
Look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:29.038 --> 00:00:30.256
See the three dots?

00:00:30.256 --> 00:00:30.804
Tap them.

00:00:32.411 --> 00:00:34.373
In the menu, tap Contests.

00:00:36.072 --> 00:00:38.623
Live now lists the contests open today.

00:00:38.623 --> 00:00:40.983
You can vote, or enter your own home.

00:00:41.884 --> 00:00:42.436
Tap Mine.

00:00:42.436 --> 00:00:45.634
These are the contests you run, and the homes you entered.

00:00:47.413 --> 00:00:51.001
Tap Past results, for finished contests and their winners.

00:00:52.879 --> 00:00:54.636
Three dots, then Contests.

00:00:54.636 --> 00:00:56.847
Live now, Mine, and Past results.

00:00:56.847 --> 00:00:58.928
And contests are on the map too.

00:01:00.331 --> 00:01:03.675
Next up: Find professionally installed displays.
